#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:1
msgid "Select layers"
msgstr "选择层"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:3
msgid ""
"Select layers deliberately when you need to quantize only part of a "
"checkpoint or exclude weights that should remain unquantized."
msgstr "当你需要仅量化检查点的一部分，或排除应保持未量化的权重时，请有针对性地选择层。"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:5
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前置条件"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:7
msgid "Before selecting layers, run inspection:"
msgstr "选择层之前，先运行检查："

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:13
msgid ""
"Use the reported module groups and checkpoint weight names as the source "
"of truth. Do not infer names from the model name alone."
msgstr "以报告的模块组和检查点权重名称为准。不要仅根据模型名称推断名称。"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:15
msgid "Choose built-in selectors first"
msgstr "优先选择内置选择器"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:17
msgid ""
"Built-in selectors are safer than regex for recognized fused layouts and "
"expert banks."
msgstr "对于已识别的融合布局和专家权重组，内置选择器比正则表达式更安全。"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md
msgid "Selector"
msgstr "选择器"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md
msgid "Coverage"
msgstr "覆盖范围"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md
msgid "`linear`"
msgstr "`linear`"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md
msgid ""
"all recognized attention, MLP, shared expert, and routed expert linear "
"layers"
msgstr "所有已识别的注意力、MLP、共享专家和路由专家线性层"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md
msgid "`attention`"
msgstr "`attention`"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md
msgid "Q/K/V/O, MLA, and other recognized attention projections"
msgstr "Q/K/V/O、MLA 以及其他已识别的注意力投影"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md
msgid "`mlp`"
msgstr "`mlp`"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md
msgid "non-routed-expert MLP linear layers"
msgstr "非路由专家的 MLP 线性层"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md
msgid "`moe`"
msgstr "`moe`"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md
msgid "routed experts and shared experts"
msgstr "路由专家和共享专家"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md
msgid "`moe.routed`"
msgstr "`moe.routed`"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md
msgid "routed experts only"
msgstr "仅路由专家"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md
msgid "`moe.shared`"
msgstr "`moe.shared`"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md
msgid "shared experts only"
msgstr "仅共享专家"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:29
msgid "`linear` does not include embeddings or `lm_head`."
msgstr "`linear` 不包括嵌入层或 `lm_head`。"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:32
msgid "Combine selectors"
msgstr "组合选择器"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:34
msgid "Multiple `--select` and `--select-name` options form a union:"
msgstr "多个 `--select` 和 `--select-name` 选项会形成并集："

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:49
msgid "Expected selection: routed experts plus attention projections."
msgstr "预期选择结果：路由专家和注意力投影。"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:51
msgid "Exclude by selector or name"
msgstr "按选择器或名称排除"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:53
msgid "Use exclusions to subtract from the selected set:"
msgstr "使用排除规则从已选集合中扣除内容："

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:68
msgid "You can also exclude a built-in group:"
msgstr "你也可以排除一个内置组："

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:75
msgid "Select by checkpoint weight name"
msgstr "按检查点权重名称选择"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:77
msgid "Use `--select-name` only when built-in selectors are too broad:"
msgstr "仅当内置选择器范围过宽时，才使用 `--select-name`："

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:91
msgid ""
"Regex patterns match checkpoint weight names. Use shell single quotes on "
"POSIX shells to avoid accidental escaping."
msgstr "正则表达式匹配检查点权重名称。在 POSIX shell 中使用单引号，以避免意外转义。"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:93
msgid "Avoid splitting fused units"
msgstr "避免拆分融合单元"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:96
msgid ""
"Do not select only part of a fused inference unit or routed expert bank. "
"Partial selection can produce artifacts that are structurally invalid or "
"unusable by inference kernels."
msgstr "不要只选择融合推理单元或路由专家权重组的一部分。部分选择可能生成结构无效或无法被推理内核使用的产物。"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:99
msgid "Avoid splitting:"
msgstr "避免拆分："

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:101
msgid "MLA-style fused pairs such as `q_a_proj` and `kv_a_proj_with_mqa`"
msgstr "MLA 风格的融合对，例如 `q_a_proj` 和 `kv_a_proj_with_mqa`"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:102
msgid "fused expert bank gate/up/down groups"
msgstr "融合专家权重组的 gate/up/down 组"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:103
msgid "partial experts inside a routed expert bank."
msgstr "路由专家权重组中的部分专家。"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:105
msgid ""
"Use built-in selectors such as `attention`, `moe`, or `moe.routed` for "
"fused structures."
msgstr "对于融合结构，使用 `attention`、`moe` 或 `moe.routed` 等内置选择器。"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:107
msgid "Handle auxiliary indexer weights"
msgstr "处理辅助索引器权重"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:109
msgid ""
"Some models include `self_attn.indexer` auxiliary modules. If these are "
"selected unintentionally, exclude them:"
msgstr "某些模型包含 `self_attn.indexer` 辅助模块。如果这些模块被意外选中，请将其排除："

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:115
msgid "Always rerun the dry-run after adding the exclusion."
msgstr "添加排除规则后，务必重新运行 dry-run。"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:117
msgid "Verify the selection"
msgstr "验证选择结果"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:119
msgid "A selection task is complete only after dry-run verification:"
msgstr "只有完成 dry-run 验证后，选择任务才算完成："

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:133
msgid "Check that:"
msgstr "检查以下内容："

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:135
msgid "selected counts match the model structure"
msgstr "已选数量与模型结构一致"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:136
msgid "no `selectors did not match` message appears"
msgstr "没有出现 `selectors did not match` 消息"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:137
msgid "no fused pair or expert bank is split"
msgstr "没有拆分任何融合对或专家权重组"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:138
msgid "selected layers satisfy bit-width, strategy, and group-size constraints"
msgstr "已选层满足位宽、策略和组大小约束"

#: ../../source/how-to/select-layers.md:139
msgid ""
"calibrated selection covers every required expert, and calibration data "
"routes tokens through each selected expert"
msgstr "校准选择覆盖每个必需的专家，并且校准数据会将 token 路由到每个已选专家"

